schway-screen 1
screen grok-device-approval
title Grok device approval
description The ephemeral Grok device code remains in the approval panel.
variant light-80
size 80x30
cursor 1 1 hidden
== text
 ⚡ schway  /project


  scripted/scripted-model · scripted API key

  Type a task · Enter sends















   Sign in to Grok
   1 Open x.ai/device
   2 Enter ABCD-EFGH
   ◌ Waiting for approval
